WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:10.500
Welcome to the Mass AI Atlas, from The Open Accelerator: Red Hat, the Massachusetts AI Hub and IBM, helping founders build here in the Commonwealth.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:17.520
This is a community map. A person checked every organization on it, and every entry shows the month they did.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.790
Tell the Atlas what you need: funding, compute, mentors, your first customers.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.485
It prints you a receipt: who can help, and what to double-check before you call.

00:00:27.805 --> 00:00:30.505
Built in the open, so add what's missing.

